            <span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="h-6 w-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-3xl">Manganese Ore</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-5">
            <p class="leading-7 text-stone-600 sm:col-span-3">
              Manganese ore is a vital component in steel production and
              other industrial processes. Our manganese ore is sourced from
              the best deposits, ensuring high manganese content and minimal
              impurities.
            </p>
            <img
              src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
              alt="Manganese ore specimen"
              class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-sm sm:col-span-2"
