            />
          </div>
          <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-800">Steel Production</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">
                Manganese is essential in the production of steel, where
                it acts as a deoxidizer and alloying element, improving
                the hardness and strength of steel. It also helps remove
                sulfur and oxygen from molten steel.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-800">Battery Manufacturing</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">
                Manganese is used in the production of batteries,
                including lithium-ion and alkaline batteries, where it
                enhances energy storage capacity and performance.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-800">Chemical Industry</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">
                Manganese compounds are used in various chemical
                processes, including the production of fertilizers,
                animal feed, and pigments.
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl border-l-2 border-amber-700 pl-4 text-sm italic leading-6 text-stone-500">
            Our manganese ore is available in different grades to meet the
            specific needs of steel manufacturers and other industrial
            users.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="rock-phosphate" class="reveal scroll-mt-32 py-16">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="h-6 w-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3c4 2 7 6 7 10a7 7 0 11-14 0c0-4 3-8 7-10z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 22v-8" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-3xl">
              Phosphatic Nodules / Rock Phosphate
            </h2>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-5">
            <img
              src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
