              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p class="leading-7 text-stone-600 sm:col-span-3">
              Phosphatic nodules are a valuable source of phosphorus, an
              essential nutrient for plant growth. Our phosphatic nodules
              are of high quality, making them ideal for the production of
              fertilizers and other chemical applications.
            </p>
          </div>
          <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-800">Fertilizer Production</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">
                Phosphorus is a critical nutrient for plants, promoting
                root development and improving crop yield. Phosphatic
                nodules are processed into phosphate fertilizers, which
                are widely used in agriculture.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-800">Chemical Industry</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">
                Phosphatic nodules are also used in the production of
                phosphoric acid, which is a key ingredient in various
                industrial processes, including the manufacturing of
                detergents, food additives, and animal feed.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-800">Environmental Applications</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">
                Phosphatic nodules can be used in environmental
                applications, such as water treatment, where they help
                remove contaminants and improve water quality.
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl border-l-2 border-amber-700 pl-4 text-sm italic leading-6 text-stone-500">
            Our phosphatic nodules are carefully selected and processed to
            ensure maximum phosphorus content and purity.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="china-clay" class="reveal scroll-mt-32 py-16">
