            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-3xl">China Clay</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-5">
            <p class="leading-7 text-stone-600 sm:col-span-3">
              China clay, also known as kaolin, is a fine, white clay used
              in a variety of industrial applications. Our china clay
              products are of the highest quality, making them ideal for
              use in ceramics, paper, and paint industries.
            </p>
            <img
              src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
